## LT UI (human-facing copy)

Kreipinys **Tu**; lakoniškai, motyvuojančiai, be patetikos.

## Security (summary)

- No API keys, passwords, or real Google Script URLs in Git
- `textContent` for user data; `.env` in `.gitignore`
- Contact form disabled — see [docs/archive/integrations/](docs/archive/integrations/) before enabling

## Before merge

See [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md): `npm test`, EN → `generate:et-lv` if needed, CHANGELOG on release.

